IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `oas-core`
IMPORT `oas-core-measures`
IMPORT `oas-core-pension`

-- Tests for s 2 "specially qualified individual" and "special qualifying factor", and s 2.1. Expected values are
-- written from the words of the definitions.

-- A person with `years` years of residence and the three yes/no facts, in the order of the record
GIVEN years      IS A NUMBER
      byMarch96  IS A BOOLEAN
      byJan2001  IS A BOOLEAN
      citizen96  IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Special qualification facts`
`the facts of` years byMarch96 byJan2001 citizen96 MEANS
    `Special qualification facts` WITH
        `years of residence in Canada after attaining eighteen years of age, as of the last day of the immediately preceding month` IS years
        `a pension or allowance was payable to the person for the month of March 1996 or an earlier month` IS byMarch96
        `a pension or allowance was payable to the person for the month of January 2001 or an earlier month` IS byJan2001
        `before March 7, 1996 the person was residing in Canada as a Canadian citizen or a permanent resident` IS citizen96

-- specially qualified individual: fewer than ten years of residence, unless an exception (a) or (b) applies
#ASSERT `the person is a specially qualified individual` (`the facts of` 3 FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `the person is a specially qualified individual` (`the facts of` 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `the person is a specially qualified individual` (`the facts of` 9.99 FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`the person is a specially qualified individual` (`the facts of` 10 FALSE FALSE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`the person is a specially qualified individual` (`the facts of` 10.0001 FALSE FALSE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`the person is a specially qualified individual` (`the facts of` 38 FALSE FALSE FALSE))
-- (a) a pension or allowance was payable for the month of March 1996 or an earlier month
#ASSERT NOT (`the person is a specially qualified individual` (`the facts of` 3 TRUE FALSE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`the person is a specially qualified individual` (`the facts of` 3 TRUE TRUE TRUE))
-- (b) payable for January 2001 or an earlier month, AND residing in Canada before March 7, 1996 as a citizen or permanent resident
#ASSERT NOT (`the person is a specially qualified individual` (`the facts of` 3 FALSE TRUE TRUE))
#ASSERT `the person is a specially qualified individual` (`the facts of` 3 FALSE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `the person is a specially qualified individual` (`the facts of` 3 FALSE FALSE TRUE)

-- special qualifying factor: one for a month before April 1996, whoever the person is
#ASSERT `the special qualifying factor of a person for the month containing` (Date 15 3 1996) (`the facts of` 3 FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the special qualifying factor of a person for the month containing` (Date 31 3 1996) (`the facts of` 3 FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the special qualifying factor of a person for the month containing` (Date 1 1 1990) (`the facts of` 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS 1
-- after March 1996: (b) the whole years over 10 for a specially qualified individual
#ASSERT `the special qualifying factor of a person for the month containing` (Date 1 4 1996) (`the facts of` 3 FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS 0.3
#ASSERT `the special qualifying factor of a person for the month containing` (Date 22 10 2026) (`the facts of` 3.7 FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS 0.3
#ASSERT `the special qualifying factor of a person for the month containing` (Date 22 10 2026) (`the facts of` 9.99 FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS 0.9
#ASSERT `the special qualifying factor of a person for the month containing` (Date 22 10 2026) (`the facts of` 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the special qualifying factor of a person for the month containing` (Date 22 10 2026) (`the facts of` 0.9 FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the special qualifying factor of a person for the month containing` (Date 22 10 2026) (`the facts of` 9 FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS 0.9
-- (a) one, where the person is not a specially qualified individual
#ASSERT `the special qualifying factor of a person for the month containing` (Date 22 10 2026) (`the facts of` 10 FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the special qualifying factor of a person for the month containing` (Date 22 10 2026) (`the facts of` 30 FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the special qualifying factor of a person for the month containing` (Date 22 10 2026) (`the facts of` 3 TRUE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the special qualifying factor of a person for the month containing` (Date 22 10 2026) (`the facts of` 3 FALSE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the special qualifying factor of a person for the month containing` (Date 22 10 2026) (`the facts of` 3 FALSE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS 0.3

-- section 2.1: the amount before any increase under subsection 7.1(1) or (2), whatever the increased amount
#ASSERT `the amount of a full monthly pension` 700 742 EQUALS 700
#ASSERT `the amount of a full monthly pension` 700 700 EQUALS 700
#ASSERT `the amount of a full monthly pension` 700 1500 EQUALS 700
#ASSERT `the pensioner's monthly pension in subsections 12(5) and 22(2)` 350.5 371.53 EQUALS 350.5
#ASSERT `the pension in subsection 12(5.1)` 350.5 371.53 EQUALS 350.5
#ASSERT `the pension in subsection 12(5.1)` 0 100 EQUALS 0
